      "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1788441600000, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "text": "整体体形\n\n主次强 + 稳定底层\n→ 条形体量 + 大底座\n\n上面集中，下面铺开", "fontSize": 28, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle"
